        "id": 1137654
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-16T18:51:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For peer_id, there\u0027s no special reason. maybe I can change it to word-size.\nFor protocol, Underlying IPC H/W has protocol field(4bits). maybe I can have BUILD_ASSERT to prevent max value of the enums doesn\u0027t exceed 1111b.",
      "parentUuid": "33524028_2061aa9c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 48,
        "startChar": 34,
        "endLine": 48,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "b3a57e3a27af3e576d0e0704c87cade6705f5286",
